title: Microsoft session cookie set by a foreign host
severity: critical
score: 80
tags: phishing, aitm
attack: T1539, T1557
description: A non-Microsoft host set a Microsoft Entra session cookie (ESTSAUTH*): the sign of a
  relayed Microsoft login in an AiTM proxy.
---
requests
| where isnotempty(host) and not owned_by(host, "Microsoft") and not allowlisted(host)
| mv-expand cookie = cookies_set
// Microsoft's ESTS session cookies, set by someone else's host
| where cookie in list("microsoft.ests_cookies")
| project host, cookie
